<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov rubber output for tyres up 4.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov rubber output for tyres up 4.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese rubber output for tyres totalled 95,466 tonnes in November, up 4.2 percent from the same month the previous year but down 2.1 percent from October, the Japan Automobile Tyre Manufacturers' Association said on Friday.</p>
<p>Domestic rubber shipments in November amounted to 58,558 tonnes, up 1.7 percent from the previous year but down 9.2 percent from October, the industry body said.</p>
<p>Exports of rubber for tyres in November totalled 36,341 tonnes, up 4.5 percent from the same period a year earlier and up 3.9 percent from October, it said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
